<p>Gurbat me uth raha hai janaza gareeb ka<br />
arzo samaa'n me shor hai barpa gareeb ka</p>

<p>
Kehte hain sar ko peet ke sab bekaso gareeb<br />
sar se hammare uth gaya saaya gareeb ka</p>

<p>Angoor e zaher daar utarte hi halq se<br />
haye haye hua hai qalb dopaara gareeb ka</p>

<p>koi na tha kare jo kifaalat imaam ki<br />
laasha taqi ne aake uthaaya gareeb ka</p>

<p>samsasam ki ye arz hai ro ro ke momino<br />
do duqhtare rasool ko pursa gareeb ka</p>